# Local dev. The client id is a PUBLIC OAuth identifier for a browser app —
# it travels in the authorization URL by design and is not a secret (the
# secret-bearing half of PKCE is generated per-request in the browser).
# Shares QA's Asgardeo app; http://localhost:5173/auth/callback must be
# registered on it alongside QA's own redirect URL.
